Shadows the upstream resource of the same name: the notification small icon
(price drops, notification-unsubscribe, actor surfaces). The shade reads a
small icon as an alpha mask, so the referenced bitmap carries the mark in
its alpha channel only (generate_icons.py, monochrome_alpha). The upstream
vector's tint macro is deliberately not reproduced: a mask needs no tint,
and the macro is private to the component that defines it.
-->
<bitmap xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:src="@drawable/taffygo_notification_glyph"
    android:gravity="center" />
